(7675486, 1254464, 138630, '<td valign="top">My top pick.  For me this has the symmetry of a planned and set-up shot (which I can appreciate) combined with the intrigue and charm of "found", candid, street photography.  The layers . . . I just love that you included everything from the table and chairs that invite us to sit right here to the fascinating window display to the reflection that carries us across the street and beyond.  I also look forward to reading the comments on this one.  Voted and bumped earlier.</td>', 'My top pick.  For me this has the symmetry of a planned and set-up shot (which I can appreciate) combined with the intrigue and charm of "found", candid, street photography.  The layers . . . I just love that you included everything from the table and chairs that invite us to sit right here to the fascinating window display to the reflection that carries us across the street and beyond.  I also look forward to reading the comments on this one.  Voted and bumped earlier.', '2020-09-27 21:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675487, 1254458, 138630, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Truly a favorite - the lighting is wonderful.  I would have placed the cat in the left pane or, since cats kind of have minds of their own . . . , cropped to move it further left.  That said, the centered position is wonderful and I''d have been wrong.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Truly a favorite - the lighting is wonderful.  I would have placed the cat in the left pane or, since cats kind of have minds of their own . . . , cropped to move it further left.  That said, the centered position is wonderful and I''d have been wrong.', '2020-09-27 21:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675488, 1254390, 138630, '<td valign="top">Overwhelming in a very good way.  Windows and more windows and more windows.</td>', 'Overwhelming in a very good way.  Windows and more windows and more windows.', '2020-09-27 21:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675489, 1254455, 138630, '<td valign="top">Please tell me you found this queer little creature exactly here - perfectly placed in the composition as well as in the dappled lighting.  It it was you who put it there . . . well conceived!   Love this.  It''s already one of my top four.  I''m thinking now I''ll bump it a bit.</td>', 'Please tell me you found this queer little creature exactly here - perfectly placed in the composition as well as in the dappled lighting.  It it was you who put it there . . . well conceived!   Love this.  It''s already one of my top four.  I''m thinking now I''ll bump it a bit.', '2020-09-27 21:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675490, 1254423, 138630, '<td valign="top">Great tones - love the autumn feel they impart.</td>', 'Great tones - love the autumn feel they impart.', '2020-09-27 21:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675491, 1254384, 138630, '<td valign="top">Yes, to your title.  Muralists usually try to work with the . . . well, with the junk they find on a building.  It''s as if here the artist said, "No way around all this crap . . . I''ll just overpower it".  And succeeded.  It really took me a bit to find all the "stuff".</td>', 'Yes, to your title.  Muralists usually try to work with the . . . well, with the junk they find on a building.  It''s as if here the artist said, "No way around all this crap . . . I''ll just overpower it".  And succeeded.  It really took me a bit to find all the "stuff".', '2020-09-27 21:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675492, 1254448, 138630, '<td valign="top">I want to see more of the figure . . . and then I''m glad I can''t.  The lines of light and shadow are perfect . . . and enough.  Lovely tones, too.</td>', 'I want to see more of the figure . . . and then I''m glad I can''t.  The lines of light and shadow are perfect . . . and enough.  Lovely tones, too.', '2020-09-27 21:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7675496, 1254458, 69668, '<td valign="top">It is always wonderful to see your images!!  Love the lighting in this!  Congrats.....glad you are still here.</td>', 'It is always wonderful to see your images!!  Love the lighting in this!  Congrats.....glad you are still here.', '2020-09-28 01:27:29.000000', NULL, 0),
