(7676008, 1254449, 259105, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Hello Marac. Good photo. And congrats on not getting a single vote below 5! What I really like in this photo is the lines of it. There is a lot of nice detail in this. Now that being said I think you might''ve scored higher if the thing on the left of the frame was removed because it is very distracting. Also by the window, it''s just a bit to white for and if you brought the whites down I think it would''ve been better. Other than those two things it''s an outstanding photo Marac, great job!<br/> <br/>Hope this was helpful and you can PM me if you have any questions for me. Good luck on your next challenge!</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Hello Marac. Good photo. And congrats on not getting a single vote below 5! What I really like in this photo is the lines of it. There is a lot of nice detail in this. Now that being said I think you might''ve scored higher if the thing on the left of the frame was removed because it is very distracting. Also by the window, it''s just a bit to white for and if you brought the whites down I think it would''ve been better. Other than those two things it''s an outstanding photo Marac, great job! Hope this was helpful and you can PM me if you have any questions for me. Good luck on your next challenge!', '2020-10-06 11:34:51.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
